            ],
            "<p><strong>Main classic multivariate data analyses</strong>:</p> <ul> <li>Principal Component Analysis</li> <li>Correspondence Analysis</li> <li>Multiple Correspondence Analysis</li> </ul> <p>The module is available in the <strong>Analyses</strong> tab.</p> <p>Project source (and changelog) is available at <a href=\"https://github.com/vjalby/vijMulti\" target=\"_blank\">Github</a>.</p>": [
                "<p><strong>Glavne klasične višedimenzionalne analize podataka</strong>:</p> <ul> <li>Analiza glavnih komponenti</li> <li>Analiza korespondencije</li> <li>Višestruka analiza korespondencije</li> </ul> <p>Modul je dostupan na kartici <strong>Analyses</strong>.</p> <p>Izvorni kod projekta (i popis promjena) dostupan je na <a href=\"https://github.com/vjalby/vijMulti\" target=\"_blank\">Github</a>.</p>"
            ],
            "<p>This module computes <strong>Correspondence Analysis (CA)</strong> for two categorical variables. Computations are based on <a href = \"https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=FactoMineR\" target=\"_blank\">FactoMineR<a/> package by F. Husson, J. Josse, S. Le, J. Mazet.</p>\n<p>The data can be</p>\n<ul>\n<li>an <strong>Observation table</strong> (raw data), possibly weighted using <em>jamovi</em> built-in weight system or using the \"Counts\" variable</li>\n<li>or a <strong>Contingency table</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Supplementary row or column</strong> numbers may be entered as integer lists : 1,3,6</p>\n<p>Four normalizations (scaling of row and column scores before plotting) are available :</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Principal:</strong> Row and column scores are scaled by eigenvalues.</li>\n<li><strong>Symmetric:</strong> Row and column scores are scaled by the square root of eigenvalues. </li>\n<li><strong>Row Principal:</strong> Only row scores are scaled by eigenvalues.</li>\n<li><strong>Column Principal:</strong> Only column scores are scaled by eigenvalues.</li>\n<li><strong>Standard:</strong> The raw coordinates without normalization.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A sample file is included at Open > Data Library > vijMulti > Smoking</p>": [
                "<p>Ovaj modul izračunava <strong>Analizu korespondencije (CA)</strong> za dvije kategorije varijabli. Izračuni se temelje na <a href = \"https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=FactoMineR\" target=\"_blank\">FactoMineR<a/> paketu od F. Husson, J. Josse, S. Le, J. Mazet.</p>\n<p>Podaci mogu biti</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Tablica promatranja</strong> (sirovi podaci), moguće težiti pomoću <em>jamovi</em> ugrađenog sustava za težiti ili pomoću varijable \"Brojač\"</li>\n<li>ili <strong>Kontingencija tablica</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Dopunski redni ili stupac</strong> brojevi mogu se unijeti kao cijeli brojevi: 1,3,6</p>\n<p>Četiri normalizacije (skaliranje rezultata reda i stupca prije prikaza) su dostupne :</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Glavni:</strong> Rezultati reda i stupca se skaliraju eigenvalueima.</li>\n<li><strong>Simetrični:</strong> Rezultati reda i stupca se skaliraju kvadratnim korijenom eigenvaluea. </li>\n<li><strong>Glavni red:</strong> Samo rezultati reda se skaliraju eigenvalueima.</li>\n<li><strong>Glavni stupac:</strong> Samo rezultati stupca se skaliraju eigenvalueima.</li>\n<li><strong>Standardni:</strong> Sirove koordinate bez normalizacije.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Uzorak datoteke je uključen u Otvori > Biblioteka podataka > vijMulti > Smoking</p>"
            ],
            "<p>This module computes <strong>Multiple Correspondence Analysis (MCA)</strong> for several categorical variables. Computations are based on <a href = \"https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=FactoMineR\" target=\"_blank\">FactoMineR<a/> package by F. Husson, J. Josse, S. Le, J. Mazet.</p>\n<p>Both classic methods are available:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Indicator matrix:</strong> CA of the indicator matrix</li>\n<li><strong>Burt matrix:</strong> CA of the Burt matrix. The eigenvalues are the squares of those of the indicator matrix method. </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Both methods give the same <em>standard</em> coordinates and discriminations (but different <em>principal</em> coordinates).</p>\n<p>When selected, <strong>Benzécri and Greenacre corrections</strong> are applied to eigenvalues only (<strong>Summary</strong> table). Principal coordinates (and inertia) of categories and observations are computed from the original eigenvalues of the Burt matrix.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Normalization</strong> options specify how the coordinates are scaled (by eigenvalues):</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Principal:</strong> Both category and observation coordinates are scaled.</li>\n<li><strong>Category principal:</strong> Only category coordinates are scaled.</li>\n<li><strong>Observation principal:</strong> Only observation coordinates are scaled.</li>\n<li><strong>Standard:</strong> Both category and observation coordinates are standard.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A sample file is included at Open > Data Library > vijMulti > Cars</p>": [
                "<p>Ovaj modul izračunava <strong>Multiple Correspondence Analysis (MCA)</strong> za nekoliko kategorijalnih varijabli. Izračuni se temelje na <a href = \"https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=FactoMineR\" target=\"_blank\">FactoMineR<a/> paketu od F. Husson, J. Josse, S. Le, J. Mazet.</p>\n<p>Dostupne su obje klasične metode:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Indikatorska matrica:</strong> CA indikatorske matrice</li>\n<li><strong>Burt matrica:</strong> CA Burt matrice. Eigenvalues su kvadrati onih iz indikatorske matrice metode. </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Obje metode daju iste <em>standardne</em> koordinate i diskriminacije (ali različite <em>glavne</em> koordinate).</p>\n<p>Kada je odabrano, <strong>Benzécri i Greenacre korekcije</strong> se primjenjuju samo na eigenvalues (<strong>Sažetak</strong> tablica). Glavne koordinate (i inercija) kategorija i promatrača se izračunavaju iz originalnih eigenvalues Burt matrice.</p>\n<p><strong>Normalizacija</strong> opcije specificiraju kako se koordinate skaliraju (prema eigenvalues):</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Glavna:</strong> Skaliraju se koordinate kategorija i promatrača.</li>\n<li><strong>Kategorija glavna:</strong> Skaliraju se samo koordinate kategorija.</li>\n<li><strong>Promatrač glavna:</strong> Skaliraju se samo koordinate promatrača.</li>\n<li><strong>Standardna:</strong> Skaliraju se koordinate kategorija i promatrača.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Uzorak datoteke je uključen u Otvori > Biblioteka podataka> vijMulti > Vozila</p>"
            ],
            "<p>This module computes <strong>Principal Component Analysis (PCA)</strong> for several continuous variables. Computations are based on <tt>stats::prcomp</tt> function.</p>\n<p>Although rotated components are not principal components, they are widely used. Only orthogonal rotations are available (from GPArotation package).</p>\n<p>Loadings (variable coordinates) and scores (observation coordinates) are principal (scaled by the square root of eigenvalues).</p>\n<p>Biplot follows \"Biplots in Practice\" (Michael Greenacre, 2010):</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Form biplot:</strong> Scores are principal (scaled by eigenvalues) while loadings are standard.</li>\n<li><strong>Covariance biplot:</strong> Loadings are principal while scores are standard. </li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Advanced options</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Standardize loadings:</strong> loadings are normalized with sums of squared equal to 1 (instead of eigenvalues)</li>\n<li><strong>Standardize scores:</strong> scores are normalized with variances equal to 1 (instead of eigenvalues)</li>\n<li><strong>Rotate eigenvectors:</strong> the rotation (varimax, etc) is applied to eigenvectors (standard loadings) instead of principal loadings (STATA way).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A sample file is included at Open > Data Library > vijMulti > Iris</p>": [
                "<p>Ovaj modul izračunava <strong>Glavnu komponentnu analizu (PCA)</strong> za nekoliko kontinuiranih varijabli. Izračuni su temeljeni na <tt>stats::prcomp</tt> funkciji.</p>\n<p>Iako su rotirane komponente nisu glavne komponente, široko se koriste. Dostupne su samo ortogonalne rotacije (iz paketa GPArotation).</p>\n<p>Opterećenja (koordinate varijabli) i rezultati (koordinate promatranja) su glavni (mjereni kvadratnim korijenom eigenvalues).</p>\n<p>Biplots slijedi \"Biplots u praksi\" (Michael Greenacre, 2010):</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Forma biplota:</strong> Rezultati su glavni (mjereni eigenvalues) dok su opterećenja standardna.</li>\n<li><strong>Kovarijacijski biplot:</strong> Opterećenja su glavna dok su rezultati standardni. </li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Napredne opcije</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Standardizirajte opterećenja:</strong> opterećenja su normalizirana sa zbrojem kvadrata jednakim 1 (umjesto eigenvalues)</li>\n<li><strong>Standardizirajte rezultate:</strong> rezultati su normalizirani sa varijancama jednake 1 (umjesto eigenvalues)</li>\n<li><strong>Rotirajte eigenvektor:</strong> rotacija (varimax, itd.) se primjenjuje na eigenvektor (standardna opterećenja) umjesto glavnih opterećenja (način STATA).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Uzorak datoteke je uključen u Otvori > Biblioteka podataka> vijMulti > Iris</p>"
            ],
